    bridge: 'Common for software, patents and certain acquired intangibles.',
    category: 'Finance & Accounting',
    indianContext: 'Amortisation comes up frequently in Indian technology, pharma and services companies where software, patents, licences and acquired intangibles form a meaningful part of the balance sheet, and finance and valuation teams need to explain to business leaders why these costs are spread over years rather than expensed immediately. It is often mentioned alongside depreciation as "D&A" in P&L discussions.',
