    dialogueSnippet: '"The acquisition added a lot of amortisation to our books because of the intangible assets we picked up."',
    trapForOfficers: 'A newcomer might not distinguish amortisation of intangibles from depreciation of physical assets, or might assume it reflects a company\'s operational performance rather than an accounting treatment tied to past intangible-asset purchases.',
