    whereSeen: 'Annual planning, finance',
    bridge: 'The approved plan against which performance may be tracked.',
    category: 'Finance & Accounting',
    priorityTier: 1,
    indianContext: 'The annual budget is the reference plan every Indian department head is measured against, agreed during planning cycles with finance and leadership, and it shapes hiring, spending approvals and target-setting for the year ahead. Deviating from budget without a clear explanation is one of the fastest ways to draw scrutiny in a management review.',
