    trapForOfficers: 'Officers accustomed to fixed sanctioned allocations may treat the budget as a rigid ceiling that can never be touched, missing that in many corporate settings the budget is a planning benchmark that gets revised and renegotiated as circumstances change through the year.',
  ),
