    category: 'Finance & Accounting',
    priorityTier: 1,
    indianContext: 'Forecasts are updated regularly by Indian finance and sales teams as new information comes in, and leadership relies on the latest forecast — not the original budget — to make near-term decisions about hiring, spending or inventory. A forecast that keeps missing badly usually triggers a deeper conversation about the assumptions behind it.',
