    bridge: 'A useful shorthand, but not a guarantee of future performance.',
    category: 'Finance & Accounting',
    indianContext: 'Indian start-ups and sales teams use run rate to quickly project where a metric like revenue is headed if current performance simply continues, giving a fast read for investor updates or internal reviews without waiting for a full year to close. It\'s popular precisely because it\'s quick, but experienced managers are careful to flag that it\'s an extrapolation, not a guarantee.',
