    bridge: 'Useful for deciding required volume or price.',
    category: 'Finance & Accounting',
    indianContext: 'Break-even analysis is used across Indian business planning, from launching a new product to opening a new outlet, to figure out the minimum volume or price needed before an initiative stops losing money. It\'s a standard slide in business cases presented to leadership before any significant investment is approved.',
