    bridge: 'A financial model, not a simple accounting statement.',
    category: 'Finance & Accounting',
    priorityTier: 3,
    indianContext: 'DCF is the core valuation technique Indian investment banking, private equity and corporate strategy teams use to estimate what a business or project is worth today, by projecting its future cash flows and discounting them back to present value. It\'s central to M&A negotiations, fundraising rounds and major investment decisions across Indian corporates.',
