    bridge: 'Focuses on overall investment and priorities.',
    category: 'Project & Program Management',
    indianContext: 'PMO and strategy teams use a portfolio view so senior leadership can decide which programs and projects get funded, deprioritised or stopped, based on overall investment and strategic fit rather than individual project detail. It is the lens used in budget and prioritisation cycles, not day-to-day delivery tracking.',
    militaryEquivalent: 'It is comparable to the overall resource and priority-setting done by a higher headquarters across multiple campaigns or theatres, deciding where effort and resources go based on strategic priority rather than operational detail.',
