    whereSeen: 'Projects, contracts',
    bridge: 'Scope discipline prevents uncontrolled expansion.',
    category: 'Project & Program Management',
    indianContext: 'Scope statements in contracts and project charters define exactly what will and won\'t be delivered, and most client disputes or change requests come down to whether something was in or out of scope. Project managers guard scope carefully because uncontrolled additions quietly erode budget and schedule.',
    militaryEquivalent: 'It is comparable to the mission parameters or task boundaries in an operation order — what the force is tasked to achieve, and just as importantly what is explicitly excluded from the task.',
