    trapForOfficers: 'Officers may assume scope can flex informally as situations change, the way a plan adapts to a changing tactical picture, when in a contractual corporate setting any scope change usually has to go through formal change control with cost and schedule implications.',
  ),
  CorporateLanguageTerm(
    term: 'Deliverable',
    fullForm: '—',
