    dialogueSnippet: '"Update the RAID log before the steering committee, especially the new assumption on the vendor\'s delivery timeline."',
    trapForOfficers: 'Officers might treat assumptions as something understood informally rather than something to formally log and revisit, when RAID discipline treats an unvalidated, untracked assumption as a real project risk in its own right.',
  ),
  CorporateLanguageTerm(
    term: 'UAT',
    fullForm: 'User Acceptance Testing',
