    militaryEquivalent: 'It is comparable to fielding the minimum viable capability first to validate the operational concept under real conditions, rather than waiting for the fully developed system before any field feedback is gathered.',
    dialogueSnippet: '"Ship the MVP first, we\'ll add the reporting dashboard in the next release once we see how users actually use it."',
    trapForOfficers: 'Officers used to thorough readiness before fielding something might criticise an MVP as "incomplete" or "not ready," missing that it is intentionally minimal to accelerate learning rather than a shortfall in preparation.',
