    bridge: 'One form of Agile, not a synonym for all Agile.',
    category: 'Project & Program Management',
    indianContext: 'Tech and product teams use Scrum\'s specific roles and ceremonies — daily standups, sprint planning, retrospectives — as their actual operating rhythm for delivery, distinct from agile philosophy in general. Job titles like "Scrum Master" and meeting names reflect this specific framework directly.',
    militaryEquivalent: 'It is comparable to one specific standard operating procedure — a defined battle rhythm of daily briefings, planning sessions and after-action reviews — that sits underneath the broader agile philosophy.',
    dialogueSnippet: '"Our Scrum Master will run the sprint planning session tomorrow morning, make sure you\'re there."',
    trapForOfficers: 'Officers may use "Scrum" and "Agile" interchangeably in conversation, when colleagues will notice that Scrum is just one specific framework within agile, not a synonym for the whole philosophy.',
  ),
