    indianContext: 'DMAIC is the structured five-phase cycle Indian quality and process improvement teams follow within Six Sigma projects, moving methodically from defining the problem through measuring, analysing, improving and finally controlling the new process so gains don\'t erode over time. It gives teams a shared, disciplined vocabulary for tackling recurring quality issues.',
