    dialogueSnippet: '"We\'re still in the Measure phase of DMAIC on this defect issue, so let\'s hold off jumping to solutions."',
    trapForOfficers: 'Officers eager to move quickly to fixing a problem might want to skip straight to the Improve phase, not appreciating that DMAIC\'s earlier Define and Measure phases exist precisely to prevent solving the wrong problem.',
