    indianContext: 'In Indian project and operations settings, an issue is something that has already happened and needs active management now, distinct from a risk which is still just a possibility, and project trackers usually keep separate logs for the two so that teams don\'t lose track of what actually needs fixing today. Clear issue logs are often what leadership reviews first in a status meeting.',
